I did a streaming list for you guys!! I'll expand it later on so you can have it going in the back for longer before checking your history and deleting the items! Don't forget to have the volume over 50% and do not skip/ride into the videos! Let's do our best for the boys, carats ♡ And thank you for the other fandoms for helping out!
Here's the link for the playlist;
https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLMRhPEE-zYX_0me3n5ZkiMHQ1KbvA6Tjx

For all the new carats

@0:25 is jeonghan 
He is a part of the vocal unit. He is known for his feminine charm especially when he had long hair. 

@0:29 that is DK or his real name Lee Seokmin. He is also a part of the vocal unit and is the main vocalist. His is known for his loud personality 

@0:32 this is Mingyu. He is the tallest member and is the visual of the group. He is also a lead rapper. He is a part of the hip hop unit. 

@0:38 this is the8 or minghao. He is one of the two Chinese members. He is a lead dancer sub vocalist and sub rapper. He is a part of the performance team. 

@0:44 that is Joshua or Jisoo. He is a lead vocalist. He is in the vocal unit. He is one of the two American members. He is are little church boy. 

@0:50 that is Vernon. He is a main rapper and a part of the hip hop unit. He is the second American member. He is known for looking like Leonardo DiCaprio. 

@0:58 this is Jun. He is a lead dancer and sub vocalist. He is a part of the performance team. He is the second Chinese member. He was a child actor before debut. 

@1:08 the one with silver hair is HOSHI or Soonyoung. He is the leader of the performance team a main dancer and lead vocalist. He is known as 10:10 because of his eyes. 

@1:20 this is Woozi or Jihoon. He is the vocal team leader and a lead vocalist. He produces most of seventeen’s songs. He is the shortest member of the group 

@1:24 this is seungkwan. His is a main vocalist and a part of the vocal team. His is known for being a diva and that is how he got his nickname diva boo. 

@1:32 this is S.coups or Seungcheol. He is the leader of the hip hop unit and the group as a whole. He is a main rapper. He is the oldest member. He is also called papa scoups. 

@1:40 is wonwoo. He is a lead rapper and in the the hip hop unit. He is seen as dark on the outside but on the inside he is a cute somewhat cold hearted baby. 

@2:34 is Dino or Lee Chan. He is the maknae. He is a main dancer and sub rapper. He is in the performance team. He is known for his role model being Michael Jackson

If you are a new carat I recommend watching going seventeen.
